  "description": "Han Jae-Hyeon, who works as a doctor at a psychiatric hospital, runs into Seo Bae-In, his one-night stand from last night, at the hospital. He realizes that Bae-In, who claims to have multiple personalities, is actually pretending to be a patient in the hope of having sex with him again...\n\nJae-Hyeon, who had been immersed in a promiscuous lifestyle, engaging in one-night stands through dating apps and even sleeping with the hospital director to advance his career, doesn’t hesitate for a moment when faced with Bae-In’s deception. Little does he know that he’s digging his own grave...\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
